    "chunk_text": "w\u00e6don: We syngodon swy\u00f0e, for \u00f0an \u00f0e we swa sp\u00e6con ongean God & \u00f0e; ac & God cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him: Wyrc ane \u00e6rene n\u00e6ddran & sete upp to tacne, & se \u00f0e tosliten beo, beseo upp to Moyses \u00f0a worhte \u00f0a \u00e6renan n\u00e6ddran, & sette to tacne; & \u00fea \u00f0e toslitene w\u00e6ron beheoldon to \u00f0\u00e6re Hi ferdon \u00f0a \u00f0anon mid heora fyrdwicum. & Moyses sende \u00f0a to Seon, \u00f0am cyninge Amoreiscre \u00f0eode, \u00f0isum wordum, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ic bidde \u00f0\u00e6t \u00d0a nolde Seon, se cyningc, nateshwon him ti\u00f0ian \u00fe\u00e6t Israhel ferde for\u00f0 ofer his gem\u00e6ru, ac Hi geeodon \u00f0a his land & ealle his burga, & Israhel wunode \u00fea on \u00feam widgillan lande. Moyses \u00f0a sende & het sceawian Azer; \u00fe\u00e6re wic hi geeodon & ahton \u00feone eard. Hi gewendon \u00f0a \u00f0anon & woldon to Basan, ac Og, se cyning, com him togeanes mid eallum his Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Moyse: Ne ondr\u00e6d \u00f0u hine; ic hine sealde to \u00feinum gewealde & eall his folc & & hi fuhton \u00f0a swy\u00f0e, & Israhel ofsloh Og \u00feone cyningc, & his suna, & his folc eall to forwyrde, & MOYSES \u00f0a ferde to Moab mid \u00f0am folce. & se cyningc Balac cw\u00e6\u00f0 to his leode: Swa adylega\u00f0 \u00feis folc mid heora fyrdcr\u00e6fte ealle \u00f0a \u00f0e He sende \u00fea his bodan to Balaam \u00f0am witegan, Beores",
